{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "contract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 状态与资源归属\nSlot／BossState持久保存ASC；AbilitySet持有本次授予句柄。\nInput持有原生来源，Hero持有Action观察及原H关联；ASC持有原请求、held/queued、有限重试许可/等待和组准入。\nASC独占一个私有绑定协议；ASC执行native ActorInfo并认证源，协议保存唯一事务元数据。Source普通值不持身份或Ready。\nGA持有原激活、终止记录和招式资源；ASC认证Try／Ended见证及发布原Notice，GAS负责执行。\nTask持原Playback／Guard、订阅、scale和Ticket；Animation管姿态，CMC唯一执行胶囊XYZ。\nCombat的Owned Window负责查询/去重；GA／GE／Execution／AttributeSet结算伤害。\n同Binding Refresh可保留原End资格；旧输入/镜头/移动/播放按原源认证。\n[[计划_玩家普攻连段|连段接口]] · [[AbilitySystem/计划_原请求终止|终止接口]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1570,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "k4notice",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOAvatarBindingNoticeEvent\nASC持有原生多播的私有封装；仅ASC可Broadcast，外部不能复制或转成可广播基类。\nASC::OnAvatarBindingNotice() → 借用订阅入口。\nAddUObject／AddWeakLambda等 → 原调用方的监听句柄。\nRemove(Handle)／RemoveAll(Object) → 撤自己的监听。\n参数：const Receipt& 与 const Notice&，原历史载荷不当当前权限。\n接收者通过IsAvatarBindingNoticeDispatching并核对自身原资源。\n实际消费者：[[Combatants/结构|Host]]原Dispatching桥接[[Character/结构|Extension]]真实Ready；Health/Base/Hero消费自己的原H。",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 2700,
      "width": 680,
      "color": "6",
      "height": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "k4exec",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 同一UGGYGOASC｜ActorInfo事务与发布接口\nGetAvatarBindingContext／CheckAvatarBindingContext：读取／核对唯一身份。\nTryExecuteAvatarActorInfoTransaction：精确Current正常准入。\nTryBootstrapAvatarActorInfoTransaction：Unissued且完整空Context。\nTryReplaceRevokedAvatarActorInfoTransaction：精确Revoked显式替换。\nIsAvatarBindingNativeWriteBusy：原生调用栈窗口；窗口内新请求Busy。\nInvalidateAvatarBinding：撤工作与匹配发布许可，保留原提交清理来源。\nPublishAvatarBindingNotice(Receipt,Query)：消费原凭据与同步纯谓词，只发布一次。\nIsAvatarBindingNoticeDispatching／IsAvatarBindingPublicationContextCurrent：原派发／当前发布上下文认证，不提供全局Ready。\nASC以TUniquePtr独占FGGYGOAvatarBindingProtocol，协议持唯一元数据/发布记录；ASC保留native写入、实际源认证和公开通知桥。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#ActorInfo事务底层与历史凭据|接口与资源]] · [[GGYGO_流程_AbilitySystem.canvas|事务流程]]",
      "y": 2080,
      "width": 730,
      "color": "5",
      "x": -560,
      "height": 560
    },
    {
      "id": "k4-failed-init-cleanup-proof",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 同一ASC｜未提交Init原写入证明\n私有const FFailedAvatarActorInfoInitCleanupProof：OriginalOperation、Before、WrittenActual。\n认证完整native Init返回但未commit的实际写入；原ActorInfo allocation防复用，Actor端点仍弱引用。\nTryCleanupFailedAvatarActorInfoInit(OriginalOperation,Query)：限定原证明的物理清理，不重捕来源。\nSucceeded仍bCommitted=false、Context空，无Receipt／Notice／Ready；原Init结果不变。\n真实后继写入、消费或ASC销毁释放证明；不存caller闭包或第二绑定。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#失败Init原写入清理（未提交证明）|数据与寿命]] · [[GGYGO_流程_AbilitySystem.canvas|清理流程]]",
      "width": 730,
      "color": "5",
      "x": -730,
      "y": 4258,
      "height": 395
    },
    {
      "id": "k4-cleanup-host-consumer",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Host清理接口\n[[Combatants/结构|CombatantState]]持有选择、原H和请求scope；ASC持有ActorInfo写入与来源证明，[[Character/结构|Extension]]持有本地通知资源。\n已提交来源：CheckAvatarBindingCleanupContext认证原Context；调用方显式选择ClearMode。\n未提交Init来源：TryCleanupFailedAvatarActorInfoInit消费原Operation与pure scope；清理不把原Init改为成功。\n清理scope与初始化scope分别负责自身资源，不从后继Context续权。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#清理调用方|调用方接口]]",
      "x": 840,
      "width": 680,
      "color": "4",
      "y": 4258,
      "height": 320
    },
    {
      "id": "k4cancel",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 同一ASC｜原归属限定清理\nTryCancelAvatarBindingAbilities(Expected,With,Without,Query)：原Context、显式标签与同步纯查询；null With不筛选，非null空With匹配零。\nTryRemoveAvatarBindingGameplayCues(Expected,Query)：原Context与同步纯清理查询；执行范围为原生Active Cue容器。\n两接口消费同一已提交清理来源、原Operation和native Busy，不改Binding／ActorInfo，不产生Receipt／Notice。\nSucceeded表示同步返回及原归属有效，不代表全部GA或异步Cue已结束。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#原归属限定取消|取消接口]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构#原归属限定Cue清理|Cue接口]]",
      "width": 730,
      "color": "5",
      "x": -560,
      "y": 3480,
      "height": 290
    },
    {
      "id": "k4-committed-cleanup-source",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 同一ASC｜已提交cleanup来源\nCheckAvatarBindingCleanupContext(Expected, OutReason) const → 纯GT认证原Issuer/Context/LastWrite、ActorInfo allocation与完整快照；Current或Revoked，不执行/签发/Ready。\n协议的唯一CommittedSource（强allocation＋Source）：逻辑撤销保留cleanup；真实typed/legacy写前退休，同端点也不续权。\nWorkingBinding仍Current/live；CommittedCleanup允许仍合法分配且Destroy中的原Owner/Avatar，无效ASC/字段变化明确失败。\nCancel/Cue/Clear消费同一来源/原native窗口；关闭Owner或宿主PreserveOwner→LifecycleClosed，调用方显式ClearActorInfo，不失败后换模式。\nTyped Clear沿既有提交/Released契约；query本身不发布。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#原已提交清理来源（Destroy）|来源/失效/模式]]",
      "x": 840,
      "width": 680,
      "color": "5",
      "y": 3405,
      "height": 365
    },
    {
      "id": "k4receipt",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOAvatarBindingPublicationReceipt\nTryGetCommittedEvidence(Result, Notice) → 先清输出，只复制历史；true不等于当前绑定／发布／Ready。\nASC唯一创建私有const Proof；保存原Kind、Before弱端点、Result／Notice，复制共享历史资源。\nInit／Refresh描述After；Clear为Released并保留Before，owner-only Init不等同Clear。\nPublish须另核对当前原Proof；历史副本仍可读取，却不能清后继或执行新动作。",
      "width": 680,
      "color": "6",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 2220,
      "height": 280
    },
    {
      "id": "input",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Input／Hero\nInput持原生来源；Hero持NativeSession、Action首观察、原ID/deadline及自身H关联。\nHero调用Receive／EndAbilityInputRequest；ASC独占held/queued、有限重试许可和等待。\nExtension Closing只退原H关联；绑定/IMC与首观察归NativeSession。\nPostProcessInput提供唯一ProcessAbilityInput帧入口。\n[[Input/结构|Input接口]]",
      "height": 290,
      "color": "4",
      "x": -1260,
      "y": 65,
      "width": 580
    },
    {
      "id": "host",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 持久状态宿主\nSlot／BossState持有ASC，Host持有Avatar选择、原H和请求scope；ActorInfo写入归ASC。\nRequestAvatarBinding消费ASC事务及发布接口；Extension持有本地H。\nHost使用原提交Context或未提交Init的原Operation分别认证自身清理，并显式传ClearMode。\nHealth／Base／Hero持有各自的H订阅与资源。\n[[Combatants/结构|Host接口]]",
      "color": "4",
      "x": -1440,
      "y": 630,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 210
    },
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# AbilitySystem｜结构图\nASC持有输入请求、组准入、ActorInfo事务及原资源认证；GA持有原激活、终止记录和招式资源；Task持有自身播放与订阅。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构|结构文档]] · [[GGYGO_流程_AbilitySystem.canvas|执行流程]] · [[计划_玩家普攻连段|连段说明]] · [[AbilitySystem/计划_原请求终止|终止契约]] · [[GGYGO_流程_原请求终止.canvas|终止流程]] · [[GGYGO_流程_伤害结算.canvas|伤害流程]] · [[GGYGO_结构_HitImpact.canvas|命中反馈]]",
      "width": 1520,
      "height": 205,
      "color": "6",
      "x": -800,
      "y": -880
    },
    {
      "id": "asc",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOAbilitySystemComponent\nReceive／End／Queue管理原输入ID、Spec held/queued、有序边沿与有限重试资源。\nNotifyAbilityFailed（final）消费独立Can来源；ASC保存真实Queued许可/等待，OnAbilityInputRetryable仅发布原观察事实。\nIsActivationBlockedByGroup提供准入查询；FinalizeAbilityGroupAdmission执行终检，ActiveAbilitiesByGroup是权威组登记。\nTryActivateAbilityWithTerminationBoundary提供原Try结果/退出见证；OnAbilityTerminationCompleted发布GA原记录完成事实。\nCheckOriginalAbilityBindingForTermination认证同Binding原allocation/ASC/Owner/Avatar，不续签工作权限。\nClientCorrectAbilityState只路由纠正；ActorInfo私有协议见下方。",
      "width": 490,
      "height": 570,
      "color": "5",
      "x": -320,
      "y": -50
    },
    {
      "id": "set",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOAbilitySet\n`GiveToAbilitySystem(ASC, Handles, Source)` → 按 AttributeSet、GA、GE 顺序授予。\n`GrantedHandles::TakeFromAbilitySystem(ASC)` → 收回这次授予。",
      "width": 490,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "4",
      "x": -320,
      "y": 850
    },
    {
      "id": "effect",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 伤害／表现接口\nDamageExecution::Execute消费Context Origin、HitResult与捕获值，写目标元属性。\nEffectContext::Duplicate保留显式Origin。\nHitImpact提供HandleGameplayCue、OnExecute与只读ResolveImpactPresentation，持有位置／表面／粒子／声音配置。\nGameplayCueManager负责Cue加载与分发。\n伤害归GA／GE／Execution／AttributeSet；Cue只拥有反馈配置与播放职责。\n[[AbilitySystem/Cues/结构|Cue接口]] · [[GGYGO_结构_HitImpact.canvas|Cue静态关系]]",
      "width": 490,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "1",
      "x": -245,
      "y": 1150
    },
    {
      "id": "attr",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## HealthSet / CombatSet\nHealthSet管生命/韧性、元属性与边界。\n有限Base为内部量；Current在0～Max。\nCurrent目标/Base提交/Post事实归HealthSet。\nCombatSet提供伤害/治疗/削韧捕获输入。\n[[Messages/结构#HealthSet 的 Current 结算|Current结算]]",
      "height": 210,
      "color": "4",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1210,
      "width": 660
    },
    {
      "id": "config",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 仲裁配置\n`UGGYGOAbilityGroupConfig`：GroupTag → 共存/独占/排队规则。\n`UGGYGOAbilityTagRelationshipMapping`：能力 Tag → 额外要求/阻断/取消 Tag。\n两者由 PawnData 注入 ASC。",
      "width": 400,
      "height": 225,
      "color": "4",
      "x": 840,
      "y": -108
    },
    {
      "id": "attribute-current-base-calculation",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 同一ASC｜Current → Base计算\nTryCalculateNumericAttributeBaseForCurrentValue(ExpectedAttributeSet, Attribute, ExpectedCurrent, DesiredCurrent)\n输入：原Set、注册FGameplayAttributeData属性、实际Current和目标Current；游戏线程／权威端。\n输出FGGYGOAttributeBaseCalculationResult；不写属性或决定业务边界。\nASC拥有实时capture、默认/CustomQualifies外调、重新capture及原Set/ASC/Owner/Base/Current/资格认证。\nGGYGOAttributeCalculation处理已认证栈值；原生临时通道不持GE或依赖，不要求持久属性Avatar Ready。\nHealthSet唯一拥有Current目标、边界、Base提交与OwnPost结果。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#Current 与 Base 数值接口|输入、输出与职责]]",
      "width": 660,
      "height": 600,
      "color": "5",
      "x": 1760,
      "y": 1210
    },
    {
      "id": "attribute-base-calculation-result",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOAttributeBaseCalculationResult\nOutcome／Reason／CalculatedBase是本次计算返回值，不持有属性或聚合器。\nReady＋None：只有有限Base候选；实际写入与OwnPost确认归HealthSet。\nRejected：无效依赖、不可逆通道、非法Divisor、非有限值或正向不匹配。\nStale：SourceChanged／AggregationChanged；原来源或聚合已经变化。\n失败值不作候选，不授权补偿、旁写Current或保存后重试。\n[[Messages/结构#HealthSet 的 Current 结算|HealthSet消费者]]",
      "width": 660,
      "color": "1",
      "x": 1760,
      "y": 2040,
      "height": 240
    },
    {
      "id": "k3-task-resource-consumer",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOAbilityTask_PlayMontageAndWaitForEvent\n持有原Ability／ActorInfo／ASC／Mesh／Anim来源与Montage唯一Slot，消费ASC单一Playback／Guard。\nRegisterNativeCallbacks在Ready前接受一次非空回调包，返回精确token；包含五普通回调、SectionReceived、NotifyReceived和OnFailed。\nTryGetOriginalSectionSnapshot输出原ID／Section／Position／Rate；作者点接口见下方。\nGA拥有原Activation、段资源及打断许可；Task事实不授工作权。\nAcquireActionPoseContract返回ExplicitNotRequired或RequiredReady及原Ticket；Required模式使用引擎TickTask只读Poll。\nOnFailed携Montage／Slot／Stage／Diagnostic和原InstanceID，是自身清理后的失败事实。\nTask管理自身监听、实例委托、缩放和Ticket；按原Guard／ID释放资源，不从当前Avatar认领后继。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#Task原实例与资源消费|接口与资源]] · [[Animation/动作姿态修正|姿态接口]] · [[计划_玩家普攻连段|GA资源]]",
      "width": 900,
      "color": "5",
      "x": 3780,
      "y": 540,
      "height": 340
    },
    {
      "id": "k3-playback-asc",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 同一ASC｜精确原Local播放归属\nTryPlayMontageWithOwnership(GA,Activation,Montage,Rate,Section,Time,Query)：返回真实播放Result，成功才签Playback。\nCheckMontagePlaybackOwnership(Original)：只读核对原Proof及实际来源；停止不抹去原清理资格。\nCaptureMontagePlaybackOwnership(GA,Spec,Activation)：只取已有认证资源，缺失为NoOwnedPlayback。\nTryClearMontageAnimatingAbility(Original)：限定匹配GA／Local清空及证明退休，不停止Montage。\nASC持唯一provenance和原ActorInfo快照；UE与Guard持各自原生权威。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#精确Montage播放归属|接口与寿命]] · [[GGYGO_流程_AbilitySystem.canvas|播放流程]]",
      "width": 820,
      "color": "5",
      "x": 2600,
      "y": -313,
      "height": 318
    },
    {
      "id": "k3-playback-values",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 原Handle／结果与Animation接缝\nFGGYGOAbilityMontagePlaybackHandle：私有const Proof，仅ASC签发；HasPlayback／HasSamePlayback只读身份。\nProof含原ASC、GA／Spec／ActivationKey、Montage、Guard完整证据与Local计数一致性；8位计数不是唯一身份。\nResult／Check／Clear：Outcome＋Reason＋Guard历史＋原Handle；Failed不补成功资源。\nAnimation Guard唯一提供生命周期／非复用CallId／CreatedInstanceId，ASC认证真实Local写入；Task只持原资源。\n限定基类写入绕行不属于项目接口认证范围；资源值不持有网络协议或帧调度。\n[[Animation/结构|Guard接口]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构#精确Montage播放归属|播放接口]]",
      "color": "4",
      "x": 2530,
      "y": -860,
      "width": 960,
      "height": 235
    },
    {
      "id": "ga",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOGameplayAbility\nCan／Activate／End／Cancel为final；CanActivateAbilityAdditional追加业务准入。\nCaptureCurrentActivation返回已有不可变Original；ResourceWork按原完整Context／LastWrite与来源认证。\nInitializeAbilityActivation提供原激活初始化；ActivateAbilityBody承接招式业务。\nRequestAbilityEnd／Cancel消费精确Original；GA持首次TerminationContext、原资源及退出义务。\nCleanupAbilityResourcesForTermination归还原激活资源；GAS持实际Active／Spec／Task与执行。\nBuildHitEffectPayload提供Context／可选Spec／Cue输入，必需Spec无效明确失败。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#激活薄hook与OnSpawn受控入口|扩展点]] · [[GGYGO_流程_原请求终止.canvas|生命周期]]",
      "width": 440,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "5",
      "x": 770,
      "y": 600
    },
    {
      "id": "ability-input-original-resource-values",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 660,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## 原输入接口／普通值\nFGGYGOAbilityInputRequestIdentity：原weak ASC＋InputRevision＋非零RequestSerial；rev0合法，弱身份保持index/serial。\nFGGYGOAbilityInputRetryRequest：InputTag＋Identity＋原World有限绝对OriginalDeadline；默认-1无效。\nReceiveAbilityInputRequest(Tag,PreviousID,Deadline)：空ID签原请求；非空复核原资源，冻结首次Spec集合／Owner/Avatar/World。\nEndAbilityInputRequest(ID,Kind)：Released按最后held发释放并保留有限tap；Invalidated精确退休，不借当前Ready或伪Released。\nASC RequestRecord持RetryableSpecHandles及QueuedWaitOrder，PendingRetries由唯一Process消费。\n公开QueueAbilityInputRetry保留精确验证/诊断；OnAbilityInputRetryable与OnAbilityGroupFreed仅为观察端口。\nResult为Accepted/AlreadyApplied/Rejected/Stale历史；值不持第二held/Ready。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#单次 Can 评估与输入失败来源|接口契约]]",
      "x": 1520,
      "y": -80,
      "height": 460
    },
    {
      "id": "w0-original-input-subscription",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOAbilityTask_WaitComboInput\nWaitComboInput(OwningAbility)返回未Ready Task；SetSourceStep提供来源段，OnPress输出SourceStep／RequestId。\nRegisterNativeCallback在Ready前接受一次非空FGGYGOComboInputNativeDelegate，返回FDelegateHandle；UnregisterNativeCallback只匹配原token。\nTask持有原弱ASC／Ability、Spec／PredictionKey、remote/predict模式及自身订阅；零key合法，桶身份不是GA激活身份。\nInputPressed来源于GAS原事件桶；本地预测使用原ASC预测窗口，远端整数载荷须通过范围校验。\nOnDestroy归还原桶中的自身handle与native注册包；GA负责Original、段序和原批次资源。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#原事件桶与输入Task订阅|接口与清理]]",
      "width": 900,
      "color": "5",
      "x": 2500,
      "y": 640,
      "height": 325
    },
    {
      "id": "montage-native-notify-interface",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 同一Montage Task｜作者点接口\nResolveOriginalMontageNotify(Montage,Name,OutTime,Diagnostic)：恰一stock native点；原LinkedMontage／branchingpoint及有限TriggerTime，缺／重／错类型拒绝。\nConfigureOriginalMontageNotify(Name,Diagnostic)：原AwaitingActivation、Ready前一次配置。\nTryGetOriginalMontageNotifySnapshot(Fact,Position)：固定ID原实例与同一作者声明的只读快照；false清输出，不合成通知。\nFNativeCallbacks.NotifyReceived／BP NotifyReceived：精确原点事实，自然blend原实例可送达，退休Task不能接旧点。\n持有原Notify UObject／名字／时间和原AnimInstance订阅；不存数组裸指针或Editor GUID，不持业务门／输入／CMC或第二时钟。\nOnDestroy只RemoveDynamic原对象／本Task／NotifyBegin函数。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#原生 Montage 作者信号|接口与来源]]",
      "width": 900,
      "color": "5",
      "x": 3840,
      "y": 1320,
      "height": 380
    },
    {
      "id": "montage-native-notify-fact",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOMontageNotifyFact\nMontage／Mesh／int32 MontageInstanceId／NotifyName／NotifyPositionSeconds。\n时间为作者GetTriggerTime含offset，非后来回调位置；快照另给原实例实际Position。\n来源封套为原Task／Guard／ActorInfo与配置原点，不借float Magnitude或ASC CancelPoint认证。\n事实不授当前播放、原GA／输入／镜头／CMC工作权。\nGA核原Activation／StepToken／Task／资源后消费，原资源持本播放许可。\n[[计划_玩家普攻连段|GA消费者]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构#原生 Montage 作者信号|数据契约]]",
      "width": 900,
      "color": "1",
      "x": 3840,
      "y": 1940,
      "height": 290
    },
    {
      "id": "actor-info-source-value",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1670,
      "y": 2470,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 620,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## FGGYGOActorInfoSource｜普通来源值\nASC、Owner/Avatar、Controller、Mesh、Movement、ActorInfo/实际AnimInstance、cached Owner/Avatar及两个AffectedAnimInstanceTag。\n弱端点与Tag按只读证据使用；不capture，不签绑定/播放身份，不表示Ready。\nASC实际快照持强ActorInfo allocation＋Source；GA激活Proof持弱allocation＋同一Source。\n外层资源决定allocation寿命与ResourceWork/Termination认证目的；值不续签旧权限。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#ActorInfo来源值|字段与外层资源]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "avatar-binding-private-protocol",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1670,
      "y": 3260,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 750,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## FGGYGOAvatarBindingProtocol｜ASC私有资源\n单个ASC以TUniquePtr独占，内部类型不向调用方开放可写状态。\n唯一持LastIssuedSerial、Context/IdentityState、CommittedSource、PendingOperation、FailedInitCleanup、native Busy与PublicationRecord。\nReserveValidatedOperation／CheckCommitOperation／CommitValidatedSource：已认证原操作与来源→唯一身份/提交元数据。\nInvalidate/Discard：撤匹配许可；TryEnter/LeaveNativeWrite：原调用栈窗口。\n来源保留/退休、发布安装/关闭/派发/消费：只管理自己的原Proof与义务。\nASC负责native Super、实际capture、外调前后重核及通知桥；协议不外调、不存谓词、不调度业务。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#ActorInfo事务底层与历史凭据|边界与接口]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "attribute-calculation-stateless",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2500,
      "y": 2260,
      "width": 820,
      "height": 680,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## GGYGOAttributeCalculation｜无状态计算\nHasSameAttributeAggregation(First,Second)：冻结聚合快照→修饰项/资格是否一致。\nPrepareNativeAttributeCalculationChannels(Snapshot,Parameters,OutChannels,OutOrder)：已认证快照→原生临时通道/顺序或明确Reason。\nIsAttributeForwardValueConfirmed(Actual,Desired)：有限正向值/目标→是否匹配。\nGGYGOAttributeBaseCalculationTypes提供Outcome/Reason/CalculatedBase普通结果。\n仅消费本次栈值，不读当前ASC/Set、不持GE/依赖/缓存；native capture、资格外调及来源认证归ASC。\nHealthSet决定目标、提交并确认本次Post；结果不授权旁写Current或保留候选重试。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#Current 与 Base 数值接口|职责与输出]]"
    }
  ],
